{"features":[{"feature_idx":0,"name":"en","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":1,"name":"wo","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":2,"name":"non_standardized","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}}],"rows":[{"row_idx":2800,"row":{"en":"divine","wo":"bu joge ca Yàlla","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nbou djogué thia Yalla\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2801,"row":{"en":"One of the most important things you can do to care for your cork flooring is to sweep, dust, or vacuum it regularly.","wo":"Lenn ci mbir yi gëna am solo yoo mëna def sooy toppatoo sa dëru liege mooy ngay faral diko bale, diko fomp ak diko aspirer.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nlene si mbir yi geuna ame solo yoo meuna def sooy topatoo sa derou liege mooy ngay faral diko balé, diko fomp ak diko aspiré.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2802,"row":{"en":"One day, a young woman named Rebecca is walking home from school when she is stopped by a group of nationalist soldiers.","wo":"Mu am benn bis ndaw su tuddu Rebecca doon dox ci kanam ekol bi jekk saa gis grubu soldaar nationalist.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou ame bene biss ndaw sou toudou rebecca done dokh thi kanam école bi diekk saa guiss groupe soldat nationaliste.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2803,"row":{"en":"Flowers grown from their upper branches are translucent to white.","wo":"Flër yiy sax ci seen car yi gëna kawe dañuy weex melni luy tàkk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFleur yiy sakh si seen car yi geuna kawé dagnouy wekh melni louy takk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2804,"row":{"en":"Elena: It sounds like it could be a very expensive business to start.","wo":"Elena: Daa melni liggéey boobu dina soxla xaalis bu bari sooy tàmbali.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nElena: da melni liguey bobou dina sokhla khaliss bou bari so tàmbali.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2805,"row":{"en":"One is to switch to cleaner energy sources, such as solar and wind power.","wo":"Benn bi mooy jëfandikoo energy bu amul ngaañ, lu ci melni kuuraŋ jant bi ak bu ngelaw li.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn bi moy dieufandiko énergie bou amoul gnan, lou thi melni courant djant bi ak bou nguelaw li.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2806,"row":{"en":"When he was finished, she approached him and asked if she could learn how to sculpt soil.","wo":"Bimu seetaanee ba noppi, mu daal di ñëw ci wetam laaj ko ndax mën nako jàngal nataal suuf.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBimou sétané ba nopi mou daldi gnew ci wetam ladj ko ndakh meun nako diangal natal souf.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2807,"row":{"en":"The princess is immediately confronted with a harsh and unforgiving world.","wo":"Pinses daal di jànkoonte ci saasi ak dundu gu metti, gu amul baale.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPinsesse daldi diankoonté thi saasi ak doundou gou meti gou amoul balé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2808,"row":{"en":"I've been swimming in the ocean, exploring the ruins of ancient cities, and eating the best things the country has to offer.","wo":"Maa ngi féey ci géej gi, di nemmeeku dëkk yu mag yi fi amoon, ba noppi di lekk li gëna neex ci li am ci dëkk bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMaa ngui féy thi guéddj gui, di nemekou deuk you mag yi fi amone, ba noppi di lekk li gueuna nékh si li am si deuk bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2809,"row":{"en":"Third, give yourself rewards for completing each step.","wo":"Ñatteel ba mooy ngay neexal sa bopp saa yoo matalee benn jéego.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNiateel ba moy ngay neukhal sa bopp sa yo matalé ben djégo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2810,"row":{"en":"Sometimes, we might be tempted to lie or cheat in order to get ahead.","wo":"Ñenn ñi mën nañu fen wala ñu def ludul yoon ngir mëna dem ci kanam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnén gni meun nagnou fén wala gnou def lou doul yoon nguir meuna dem thi kanam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2811,"row":{"en":"Ben’s clingy behaviour begins to annoy Amy, who is also struggling to cope with her family life.","wo":"Ben ku tàqe la, te loolu mingi bëgga soof Amy ndax moom itam dafa wara toppatoo famiyam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBen kou taqé la té lolou moungui beuga soof amy ndakh mom itam dafa wara topato famiyam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2812,"row":{"en":"Buddha, in one of his famous quotes, pointed out that the origin of suffering is precisely attachment.","wo":"Lenn ci li Buddha wax te mu siiw lool mooy liy gëna faral di teg nit tiis mooy limu bëgg lool ci xolam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLene si li bouddha wakh té mou siw lol moy liy geuna faral di tegg nitt tiiss moy limou beugg lol si kholam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2813,"row":{"en":"I don't know, Tom, said his friend, Ben.","wo":"Ben ni ko, Tom, xamuma ci dara.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn niko tom khamouma si dara\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2814,"row":{"en":"I also applied some over-the-counter hydrocortisone cream to help relieve the itching.","wo":"Maa ngi ciy diw itam benn pomade buñ ma jaay te soxlawul ordonaas, diko ci diw ngir dakkal xasan gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMaa ngui thiy diw itam bene pomade bougn ma diay té sokhla woul ordonnance, diko thiy diw nguir dakal khassane gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2815,"row":{"en":"We treat behavioral problems, emotional distress, cognitive loss, prolonged grief reactions, and severe mental illness.","wo":"Dañuy faj feebaru xel, xel mu dalul, nit ku tàggoo ak sagoom, ku ñàkk xelam, ku metit sonal xelam ak bepp feebaru xel.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagnouy fadj feebaru hel, hel mou daloul, nitt kou taggoo ak sagom, kou gnak helam, kou metitt sonal helam ak bepp feebaru hel.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2816,"row":{"en":"Doctor: And does anything make it better.?","wo":"Doktër bi: Ndax amna lu koy féexal?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDocteur bi: ndakh amna loukoy fékhale ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2817,"row":{"en":"Clay is a natural material that is found in the ground.","wo":"Ban ci suuf si lay nekk mën nga ko amee fu nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nbane ci souf si lay nekk meun nga ko amé fou nekk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2818,"row":{"en":"The result is a work of art that is both visually stunning and emotionally moving.","wo":"Lépp soo ko boolee mu nekk art bu neexa xool di dawloo yaram.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLepp soko bolé mou nek art bou nékha khol di dawlo yaram.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2819,"row":{"en":"One day, the linguist was working on a new translation of a difficult poem when he had a breakthrough.","wo":"Benn bis, jëkkër ji nekkoon di tekki làkku benn taalif bu naqaree tekk, jekk saa rek am lu ñëw ci xel mi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn biss dieukeur dji nékone di tekki lakou benn taalif bou nakharé tékk, diekk saa rek am lou nieuw thi khel mi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2820,"row":{"en":"Second, break down the task into smaller steps.","wo":"Ñaareel ba mooy nga xaaj liggéey bi ay pàcc yu néew.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ngnarel ba moy nga khadj liguey bi ay patche you new.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2821,"row":{"en":"We played on the swings and the slide for a while, then we went back inside for lunch.","wo":"Fo nanu ci balansoir bi, ak tobogan bi tuuti, ginaaw ga nu dello ci biir añi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFo nanou thi balançoire bi ak tobogan bi touti, guinaw ga niou dello si biir agne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2822,"row":{"en":"Plus there is a cute thatched hut with 4 showers in it for that quick rinse off after a swim in the ocean or a dive.","wo":"Boole ci amaale na néegu ñax bu rafet ameele 4 duusu sangu ginaaw boo féeyee wala nga tëmb ci géej gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBoolé thi amalé négu niakh bou raféte amélé 4 doussou sangou guinaw bo féyé wala gua teumb thi guédj gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2823,"row":{"en":"One day, I was playing with Cocoa in the backyard when I noticed that she was chewing on something.","wo":"Benn bis dama doon fo ak Cocoa ci ëtt bi ci ginaaw, jekk saa ma seetlu ni amna lumuy sàqami.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn biss dama done foo ak cocoa thi eutt bi thi guinaw, diekk saa ma setlou ni amna loumouy sakhami.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2824,"row":{"en":"As more research is done in this area, we can expect to see even more advances in the use of data to help people with mental health issues.","wo":"Ginaaw ñu ngi gëna gëstu ci xam-xam boobu, noo ngi am yaakaar mu wane njariñ li ci jëfandikoo ay done ngir jàppale nit ñi am feebaru xel.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGinaaw gnou ngui geuna guestou si kham-kham bobou, no ngui ame yakar mou wané ndiarign li si dieufandiko ay done nguir diapalé nitt gni ame febarou khel.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2825,"row":{"en":"The right to freedom of expression is recognized as a necessary precondition for the enjoyment of all other human rights.","wo":"Ñépp bokk nañu nangu ci nit ñi dañu wara am sañ-sañu fësal seen xalaat ndax ñu mën ni am nañu yeneen yelleefu doomi aadama yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGneup bokk nagnou nangou thi nitt gni daniou wara ame sagn sagnou feusal seen khalaate ndakh gnou meun ni ame nagnou yeneen yellefou domi aadama yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2826,"row":{"en":"The customer was tempted to buy a few things, but they hesitated.","wo":"Kiliyaan bi demoon na bay waaja jënd yenn mbir, waaye xelam xawul dal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKiliyan bi démone na bay wadia dieund yenn mbir wayé khélam khawoul dalé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2827,"row":{"en":"Cousin 1: But what if we really do fail?","wo":"Cousin 1: Waaye sudee jàllu nu nak?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCousin 1: Wayé soudé diallou gnou nak ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2828,"row":{"en":"Suppose a group of activists enter a busy setting (mall, movie theater, theme park, etc.) looking like everyone else.","wo":"Xalaatal ak ñaxtukat dugg ci barab bu ñu bari di daje (centre komersiyaal, sinemaa, theatre wala pàrk) ba noppi nuróo ak ñépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalatal ak niakhtoukat dougg si barab bou gnou bari di dadjé (centre commercial, cinéma, theatre wala parc) ba noppi nuróo ak nieupé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2829,"row":{"en":"The fatal flaw in that argument is that the teacher's contract is not the system.","wo":"Fi yaxxu fii ci wax ji mooy ni contrawu jangalekat bi du sistem bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFii yakhou fii thi wakh dji moy ni contrawou diangale kat bi dou system bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2830,"row":{"en":"Elephants are the largest land animals on Earth and can weigh up to 15,000 pounds.","wo":"Ñay mooy rabu àll bi gëna rëy ci kaw suuf, te diisaayam mën yegg ba 15,000 livre.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ngnay moy rabou alle bi geuna reuy thi kaw souf té diassayame meun yeugue ba 15000 livre\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2831,"row":{"en":"When you play outside, you get exercise and you meet new people.","wo":"Sooy fo ci biti, dangay tàggat sa bopp ba noppi nga xam nit ñu bees.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSooy foo thi biti dangay taggat sa bopp ba noppi nga kham nitt gnou bess.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2832,"row":{"en":"When you make a mistake, the ocean gives you an instant reminder.","wo":"Soo defee benn njuumte, géej gi daf la koy wan ci saasi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo défé beneu ndioumté, guédj gui daf lako wane thi saasi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2833,"row":{"en":"When content is translated, it becomes accessible to a wider audience, which can lead to increased sales and profits.","wo":"Suñu tekkee làkku ëmbiit li, ñi koy mëna jëfandikoo dañuy gëna bari, muy lu mëna yokk njaay mi ak benefis yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSougnou teké lakou umbiit li gni koy meuna dieufandiko daniouy geuna bari mouy lou meuna yokk ndiaye mi ak benefis yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2834,"row":{"en":"Ingredients: 1kg pork belly, 1 tbsp English mustard, 1 tbsp black treacle, 1 tbsp cider vinegar, 1 tbsp Worcestershire sauce, 1 tbsp vegetable oil, 1 large onion, 4 cloves garlic, 2 bay leaves, 1 sprig of thyme, 100ml cider, 100ml chicken stock, 1 tbsp cornflour, 2 tbsp cold water.","wo":"Yi ciy dem: 1kg dënnu mbaam, 1 kuddu bu mag mutard àngle, 1 kuddu bu mag mélasse bu ñuul, 1 kuddu bu mag bineegar cidre, 1 kuddu bu mag sauce Worcestershire, 1 kuddu bu mag diwu lujum, 1 soble mu mag, 4 doomi laaj, 2 xobi loriye, 1 thym pringtemps, 100ml cidre, 100ml buyoŋu ginaar, 1 kuddu bu mag sungufu mboq, 2 kuddu yu mag ndox mu sedd.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYii si dem: 1kg deunou mbam, 1 koudou bou mag moutarde angle, 1 koudou bou mag mélasse bou nioul, 1 koudou bou mag binegar cidre, 1 koudou bou mag sauce worcestershire, 1 koudou bou mag diwou lougium, 1 soblé mou mag, 4 domi ladj, 2 khobi lorié, 1 thym printemps, 100ml cidre, 100ml bouyonou guinar, 1 koudou bou mag sungufou mbokh, 2 koudou you mag ndokh mou sedd.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2835,"row":{"en":"Patient: I will Dentist: (hands the patient a list of instructions) Here are some instructions on how to care for your new filling.","wo":"Malaad bi: Waaw doktër, inchalla: (mu jox malaad bi ay tegtal yumu wara topp) Lii daf lay tegtal ni nga wara toppatoo bëñ bu ñuy sooga platre.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMalaad bi: waw docteur inchallah (mou diokh malaad bi ay tegtal youmou wara top) lii daf lay teugtal ni nga wara topatoo beugn bou gnuy soga platre\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2836,"row":{"en":"Since the pre-industrial period, human activities are estimated to have increased Earth's global average temperature by about 1 degree Celsius (1.8 degrees Fahrenheit), a number that is currently increasing by 0.2 degrees Celsius (0.36 degrees Fahrenheit) per decade.","wo":"Bi usine yi tàmbalee di am ba leegi, xayma nañu ni liggéeyu nit ñi dañu yokk tàngoor wi ci kaw suuf lu mat 1 degre Celsius (1.8 degre Fahrenheit), muy lim buy yokk lu tollu ci 0.2 degre Celsius (0.36 degre Fahrenheit) fukki at yu nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi usine yi tambalé di ame ba légui, xayma nagnou ni ligueyou nitt gni daniou yokk tangoor wi thi kaw souf lou matte 1 degré Celsius (1.8 degré Fahrenheit), mouy lim bouy yok lou tollou si 0.2 degré Celsius (0.36 degré Fahrenheit) foukki att you nekk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2837,"row":{"en":"I was recently cleaning out my attic when I came across a box of old recipes that had been passed down from my grandmother.","wo":"Keroog dama doon defar sama sàq, maa daal di daje ak benn boyet bu defoon téere rëset bu yàgg bu fi sama maam ju jigéen bàyyi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKéroog dama done defar sama sac ma daldi dadjé ak ben boyet bou defone tééré reuset bou yagg bou fi sama mame djiguéne bayyi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2838,"row":{"en":"The linguist was starting to lose hope, and the pastry chef was worried that their reputation would be ruined if they couldn't have a child.","wo":"Jëkkër jaa ngi tàmbali woon di ñàkk yaakaar, jabar ji di xalaat ni deram dina yàqu suñu mënul am doom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDieukeur dja ngui tambali wone di gnakk yakar, djabar dji di khalat ni deram dina yakh sougnou meunoul ame dome.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2839,"row":{"en":"One of the most famous unsolved mysteries is the disappearance of Amelia Earhart.","wo":"Benn ci kumpa yi gëna mag te ba leegi kenn xamul lumu doon mooy réerug Amelia Earhart.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn thi kumpa yi geuna mag té ba légui kénn khamoul loumou done moy réroug Amelia Earhart.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2840,"row":{"en":"Your primary mission is to destroy all enemy defenses and collect fuel to stay alive.","wo":"Li nga wara njëkka def mooy tas bépp kaaraange bu say noon am ba noppi nga jël seen petrol ngir mëna dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi nga wara ndieuka def moy tass bepp karangé bou say none ame ba noppi nga dieul sen petrol nguir meuna doundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2841,"row":{"en":"He ties the marlin to the side of the boat and begins to row back to shore.","wo":"Mu takk jën wi ci wetu gaal, daal di tàmbali joow ngir teeri.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou tak dieun wi si wetou gaal, daldi tambali djow nguir teuri.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2842,"row":{"en":"I especially liked the way the director used light and shadow to create a sense of atmosphere.","wo":"Lima ci gëna neex mooy bi realisatër bi jëfandikoo leer ak lëndëm ngir génne ci lu rafet.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLima si geuna nekh moy bi realisateur bi dieufandiko leer ak leundeum nguir guéné si lou rafeté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2843,"row":{"en":"Man: We are the people! We are the future! We will not give up!","wo":"Ku góor ki: Nun nooy askan wi! Nooy ëlëgu réew mi! Dunu xàddi!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou goor ki: Nounou gnoy askane wi! Gnoy eleugou rewmi! Dougnou khaddi!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2844,"row":{"en":"This device will send you to another space where you will be able to see the effects of smoking on your health.","wo":"Aparey bii daf lay yóbbu ci beneen barab booy mëna gisee li tóx di yàgg ci sa wérgi-yaram.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAppareil bii daf lay yobou thi beneen barab boy meuna guissé li tokh di yagg thi sa wergui yaram.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2845,"row":{"en":"Fortunately, her boss and colleagues understood that she might be late arriving at the Google campus.","wo":"Amna chance, kilifam aki nattangom liggey yi nangunañu ni moom mënna yiixa agsi ci Google campus.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmna chance kilifam ak nattangom liguey yi nangounaniou ni mom meuna yiha agsi thi google campus.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2846,"row":{"en":"Also note that you are studying an earlier draft of the poem.","wo":"Ngeen bàyyi xel itam ni, lii ngeen di jàng sumb négandikub taalif rekk la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGneen bayi khél itam ni lii nguen di diangue sumb négandikoub taalif rek la\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2847,"row":{"en":"Then she led him to a nearby town.","wo":"Ginaaw loolu mu yóbbu ko ci dëkk bi gëna jege.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGinaaw lolou mou yobouko thi deuk bi geuna diegué.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2848,"row":{"en":"Serve immediately.","wo":"Yakk ko ci saasi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYakh ko thi saasi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2849,"row":{"en":"Zambia has a population of over 17 million people and a land area of 752,618 square kilometers.","wo":"Zambie amna askan wu ëpp 17 milioŋ ciy nit, seen yaatuwaayu suuf matna 752,618 kilomet kare.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nZambie amna askane wou eup 17 million ciy nitt, seen yaatuwaayou souf matna 752618 kilometres carré.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2850,"row":{"en":"It was a quick and easy way to make a difference in the world.","wo":"Mooy anam wu gaaw te yomb ngir jàppale nit ñi ci àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoy anam wou gaw té yomb nguir diapale nitt gni si addouna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2851,"row":{"en":"But how can I do that? asked the young woman. The world is so full of suffering.","wo":"Jigéen ju ndaw ji laajaat ko, Waa ndax dinaa ko mën? Àdduna bi coono neen la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjiguéne dji ndaw dji ladjat ko, wa ndakh dina ko meuneu ? Addouna bi thiono néne la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2852,"row":{"en":"Doctor: Have you had any other symptoms? Nausea, vomiting, diarrhea?","wo":"Doktër bi: Ndax amna yeneen mbir yu mu àndal? Xel muy teey, waccu, biir buy daw?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDocteur bi: ndakh amna yenen mbir youmou andal? Khel mouy tey, wathieu, biir bouy daw?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2853,"row":{"en":"Therapist: It's understandable that you're feeling frustrated.","wo":"Terapist bi: Xamnaa ni am nga lula metti, te xel mën nako nangu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTerapist bi: khamna ni ame nga loula meti té khél meune nako nangou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2854,"row":{"en":"In addition to the safety risks, these types of damage can also be expensive to fix.","wo":"Lu weesu looraange yi, xeetu yàqu-yàqu yooyu mën na seer soo koy defar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLou wessou loorange yi kheutou yakh you muna seer so koy defar\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2855,"row":{"en":"One example is a recent video that went viral of a cat trying to fit into a small box.","wo":"Benn ci xeetu wideo yooyu bi defoon bëz mooy muus mi doon jéema dugg ci benn kees.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn thi xeetu video yoyou bi defone buzz moy muuss mi done djééma dougg thi benn késs.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2856,"row":{"en":"The investigation revealed the elderly male has a suspended license.","wo":"Lànket bi dafa wane ni dañu nangu permi dawalu mag mii.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLanké bi dafa wané ni daniou nangu permis dawalou mag mii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2857,"row":{"en":"A: I agree. I think the dowry system is a relic of a bygone era.","wo":"A: Ànd naa ci. Jàpp naa ni lii lufi maam yi bàyyi la te daa xewwi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nHannd naa thi. Djapp naa ni li loufi mame yi bayyi la té da hewi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2858,"row":{"en":"Each storage position layer is isolated with a stainless steel plate and fireproof rock wool.","wo":"Bépp etaaseeru dencukaay amna leen bu dëgër bu koy xàjjale ak yeneen yi ba safara duko manal dara;","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBepp etaaseurou deuncoukay amna len bou deugeur bou koy khadjale ak yenen yi ba safara douko manal dara;\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2859,"row":{"en":"The man angrily gets up and storms out of the club.","wo":"Waa ji mer bay futtu, waaxu génn club bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWaa dji mer baye foutou wahhou guenn club bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2860,"row":{"en":"We were concerned about the health of the employees at this firm, said Dr. Raymond Neal-Kennedy, a spokesman for the SMA.","wo":"Dr. Raymond Neal-Kennedy yor kàddu waa SMA neena, Sunu xel dalul ci wérgi-yaramu liggéeykat yi ci entreprise bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDr Raymond Neal-Kennedy yorr kadou wa SMA néna, sounou hel daloul thi wergui yaramou ligueykat yi si entreprise bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2861,"row":{"en":"Now excuse me while I stick a bar of soap in my mouth to get rid of that unpleasant sentence.","wo":"Leegi nak nga baal ma ci lima jël bantu saabu duggalko sama gémiñ ngir jëlee fa wax ju neexul ji.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLegui nak nga balma si lima dieul bantou sabou douggalko sama guemign nguir dieulé fa wakh djou nékhoul dji.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2862,"row":{"en":"When you become a queen, you will have power.","wo":"Soo nekkee reine dangay am kàttan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo neké réne dangay ame katane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2863,"row":{"en":"bastard","wo":"doom bu jigéen ci buur","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ndom bou djiguéne thi bour\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2864,"row":{"en":"After a while, the boy's parents called him over, and he said goodbye to the paleontologist.","wo":"Nis tuut, ay waajuri xale daal di koy woo, ci noonu mu tàggatoo ak paleontologist bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNiss tout, ay wadiouri khalé daldi koy woo, thi nonou mou taggato ak paleontologist bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2865,"row":{"en":"I was proud to beat my opponent with a witness present.","wo":"Kontaan naa loolu bima dumaa sama noon ba noppi mu kuko seede.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nContane na lolou bima douma sama noon ba nopi mou kouko sédé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2866,"row":{"en":"Humans have evolved and developed to become the dominant species on Earth.","wo":"Nit ñi di màgg di dem ba nekk mbindéef yi ëpp doole ci kaw Suuf si.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNit gni di magg di dem ba nek mbindéef yi eup dolé thi kaw Souf si.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2867,"row":{"en":"The sun was shining, the birds were singing, and the clouds were below us.","wo":"Jànt baa ngi leer nàññ, picc yaa ngir way, niir yaa ngi nu tiim.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiant ba ngui leer nagn, picc yaa ngir way, niir ya ngui nou tiim.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2868,"row":{"en":"No wonder these poor pre-moderns were mad and wicked and miserable.","wo":"Amul werante yii pre-modern dañu dofoon, soxor ba noppi torox.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmoul weranté yii pre-modern daniou dofone, sokhar ba nopi torokh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2869,"row":{"en":"However, her addiction soon took over and she began to neglect her kittens.","wo":"Waaye dafa dem ba drog bi ëpp ko doole, mu tàmbali di sàggane muusam yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé dafa dem ba drogue bi eup ko dolé mou tambali di sagané moussam yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2870,"row":{"en":"Higher-protein diets are often recommended for older consumers;","wo":"Régime bu bari protein lool lañuy faral di digal mag ñi;","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRégime bou bari protéine lool lagniouy faral di digueul magni.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2871,"row":{"en":"It is one of the world's major religions, with over 2 billion followers.","wo":"Benn la ci diine yi gëna mag ci àdduna bi, am 2 milyaari nit ñu ko topp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn la si diiné yi geuna mague si addouna bi, ame 2 milyar niit gnou ko top.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2872,"row":{"en":"I was both excited and nervous, not knowing what to expect.","wo":"Kontaanoon naa ba noppi amaale tuuti tiitaange ndax xamu ma luma fay fekki.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nContanoone na ba nopi amalé touti titaangé ndakh khamouma louma fay fekki.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2873,"row":{"en":"Most of the current warming trend is extremely likely (greater than 95 percent probability) the result of human activity since the 1950s and is proceeding at an unprecedented rate over decades to millennia.","wo":"Tàngoor yiy gëna faral di am dañu yaakaar ni (warna ëpp 95 pourcent) nit ñee ko liggéey li tàmbale ci ati 1950 te mingi yokk bu baax ci tóo bu musul am ay deseni jàpp ay milineer.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTangor yiy geuna faral di ame daniou yakar ni (warna eup 95 pourcent) nitt gni ko liguey li tambalé si ati 1950 té mingui yokh bou bakh si too bou meusoul ame ay deseni diap ay milineer.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2874,"row":{"en":"With the advent of sophisticated surveillance and technological innovation, a level of caution must be exercised.","wo":"Ak coppite yu bees ci am ci wàllu xaralay surveillance ak niñu gënee xarañ, ku nekk danga wara jël sa matuwaay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nak coppité you bess thi ame thi walou kharalay surveillance ak nignou gueuneu kharagn, kou nek danga wara dieul sa matouwaye.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2875,"row":{"en":"The dog's gentle tongue helped to soothe Raman's pain, and he soon forgot all about his injury.","wo":"Nooyaayu làmmiñu xaj bi daal seddal metit wi Raman amoon, noonu xelam dem bamu fàtte ni daa gaañu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNooyayou lamignou khadj bi daal sedal metite wi raman amone nonou helam dem bamou faté ni da ganiu\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2876,"row":{"en":"rarely","wo":"néew na lu muy","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nnéw na loumouy\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2877,"row":{"en":"Trimming your dog's nails is a necessary part of grooming, but it can be a daunting task for some pet owners.","wo":"Sooy yar xaj fàww ngay faral di dagg ay wewam, waayé loolu mën na baña yomb ci yenn yarkat yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSooy yar khadj faw nga faral di dag ay wéwam wayé lolou meun na bagna yomb thi yenn yarkat yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2878,"row":{"en":"Make sure children understand appropriate and safe behavior.","wo":"Fexeel ba xale yi xam luy jikko ju baax ak jëf ju rafet.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFékhél ba khalé yi kham louy djikko djou bakh ak dieuf djou rafet.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2879,"row":{"en":"Even a waiter who isn’t a secret agent in disguise might mention it to his supervisor or something.","wo":"Liggeeykat biy joxé lekk ak naan sax bu doonul ab deñ kumpa bu laxxatu meunn nako jottali way wottuwam wala lu mell nonu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLiggeukat biy diokhé lekk ak nan sakh bou doneul ab deugn koumpa bou lakhathou meun nako diottali way wottouwam wala lou mel nonou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2880,"row":{"en":"They have all learned a lot about teamwork and sportsmanship, and they have all had a lot of fun.","wo":"Jàng nañu lu bari ci liggéeyandoo ci ekip ak jàppalante, boole ci ñépp am nañu ci bànneex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjagn nagnou lou bari thi ligueyando thi ekip ak diaphalanté, boolé thi nieup am nagnou thi banékh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2881,"row":{"en":"In this case, you want to shoot in the best available natural light (near a window) and disable your flash.","wo":"Su demee nii, dangay bëgg defee nataal bi ci babab bi gëna am leeralu bëccëg (ci wetu palanteer bi), nga dindi flash bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou démé nii, dangay beug défé nataal bi si babab bi geuna ame léralou beuthieug (si wetou palanteer bi), nga dindi flash bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2882,"row":{"en":"Don't judge a book by its cover is a popular saying that means one should not make assumptions about something based on its outward appearance.","wo":"Bu leen gis melokaanu nit rek nga bëgga am foo ko dëkkal muy wax ju siiw ju ñuy moytuloo ñuy bañ di gis nit rek daal di ko dëkkal fenn fi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBou léne guiss mélokhanou nitt rek nga beuga ame foo ko deukal mouy wakh djou siw djou gnuy moytoulo gnuy bagn di guiss nitt rek daldi ko deukal fénne fi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2883,"row":{"en":"In fact, I think it can put women in danger.","wo":"Booy seet, loolu mën na yóbbe ku jigéen ki fitna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBoy sétte lolou meun na yobou kou djiguéne ki fitna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2884,"row":{"en":"resistance","wo":"fimu war a nekk","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nfimou warra nekk\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2885,"row":{"en":"Basically he's dizzy, can hardly walk, lost his balance, speech was impaired, said spectacular things.","wo":"Sooy xool dafay miir, mënul dox bu baax, mënul taxaw bu jub, waxam leerul, di wax mbir yu yéeme.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSooy khol dafay mire meunoul dokh bou bakh meunoul takhaw bou djoub wakham leeroul di wakh mbir you yeumé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2886,"row":{"en":"When we clean the house, we are not only making our living space more comfortable, but we are also creating a sense of order and peace.","wo":"Sooy defar kër gi mu set, yamu nu rek ci fexe sunu dëkkuwaay neexe nekk, waaye nu jàngale waale lii di ranger ay mbir ak jàmm.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSooy defar keur gui mou set yamu gnou rek thi fekhé sounou deukouway nékhé neuk waayé gnou diangalé walé lii di ranger ay mbir ak diam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2887,"row":{"en":"If you’re worried about helmet hair, simply keep a comb or brush in your desk drawer.","wo":"Soo bañee am kawar gu jaxasoo nit mbaxane, dugal broos wala peñe ci sa tiruwaaru biro.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo bagné ame kawar gou diakhasso nitt mbakhane dougal broos wala pene thie sa tirouwarou bureau.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2888,"row":{"en":"It's time to start acting like adults.","wo":"Dafa jot ngeen def yëfi mag.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa diote ngen def yeufi mague.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2889,"row":{"en":"Eva Green, a 25-year-old woman from London, has been missing for over a week.","wo":"Eva Green, jigén la woon, mingi amoon 25 at bawoo London, defna benn a yu-bis kenn gisu ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nEva Green djiguéne la wone mingui amone 25 ans bawoo london defna béne a you-biss kéne guissou ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2890,"row":{"en":"The importance of love for Jesus is central to Christianity.","wo":"Bëgg Jesus lu am solo la ci képp kuy Chretien.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeugue jesus lou am solo la thi kep kouy chretien.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2891,"row":{"en":"are you married or single","wo":"dangay séy wala salibateer nga","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ndagay seuy walla salibater nga\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2892,"row":{"en":"He realized that the key to having a child was to find a way to combine their two passions.","wo":"Mu xamni li leen nara may doom ñoom ñaar mooy ñu boole seeni bëgg-bëgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou khamni li léne nara may dom gnom gnaar moy gnou boolé séni beug beug\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2893,"row":{"en":"She delivers her lines perfectly and the audience is thrilled.","wo":"Waxna liñu ko bindaloon lépp te juumu ci nit ñi yéemu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWakhna lignou ko bindalone leup té djoumou thi nitt gni yeumou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2894,"row":{"en":"I’m looking for someone who is kind, intelligent, and funny, I said.","wo":"Mani ko, Li may wut mooy nit ku baax, mu muus, ba noppi xoromu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMani ko li may wout moy nitt kou bakh mou mousse ba noppi khoromou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2895,"row":{"en":"She had been looking forward to this day ever since her teacher, Ms. Singh, had announced that they would be doing a unit on different cultures. I've never had Indian food before, said Priya's friend, Sam. What's it like?","wo":"Bis ba ko Madam Singh mi koy jàngal waxee ni dina ñu jàng aada yeneen réew yu wuute ba leegi amatul jàmm. Xaritu Priya bii di Sam daaldi